	"tips": "・Student visa is for **full-time study at Japanese educational institutions** including universities, vocational schools, and language schools\n\n・Requires **acceptance at an accredited institution** and proof of sufficient financial resources for studies\n\n・Check the latest application requirements at the [Immigration Services Agency](https://www.moj.go.jp/isa/)\n\n・**Part-time work permission** allows up to 28 hours per week with proper work permit\n\n・Must maintain **good academic standing** and proper attendance to maintain visa status",
